[RTC] es1227-54ts DTS: RTC model is DS1338, not DS1388 (wrong compatible
binds rtc-ds1307 driver in DS1388 mode -> garbage time, date shows 2002).
Re-apply of pre-SAI-1.17 fix 7282f6fb9; the 6.12 kernel branch imported
the DTS from before that fix.

--- a/src/sonic-linux-kernel/patches-sonic/0016-arm64-dts-marvell-Add-Wistron-ES-1227-54TS-board.patch
+++ b/src/sonic-linux-kernel/patches-sonic/0016-arm64-dts-marvell-Add-Wistron-ES-1227-54TS-board.patch
@@ -274,8 +274,8 @@
 +			#size-cells = <0>;
 +			reg = <4>;
 +
-+			rtc0:rtc-ds1388@68 {
-+				compatible = "dallas,ds1388";
++			rtc0:rtc-ds1338@68 {
++				compatible = "dallas,ds1338";
 +				/* PDF P13 : 1101 000 R/nW , 0x68+ R/nW */
 +				reg = <0x68>;
 +			};
